{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108550","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1510855001:1":{"text":"さっきのは<style=\"highlight\">狩猟神の幻影</style>か？","source_cn":"刚才那是<style=highlight>狩猎神的幻象...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x174DF41FFDD7CE6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510855002:1":{"text":"ええ。本物の神が、あんな簡単に倒されるはずがありません。","source_cn":"是的，真正的神明不可能轻易被我们击败。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4700951F240E22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510855003:1":{"text":"ったく、面倒くさい……ひとまずレコルオーブを回収しておこう。","source_cn":"唉，真麻烦……先捡起地上的记忆球吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16663491CB567A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510855004:1":{"text":"これからは一層用心して進めよ。どこに狩猟神の幻影が隠れてるか分からないからな。","source_cn":"接下来的路得更小心了，说不定哪里又埋伏着一个狩猎神的幻象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20541F121F576C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"モルガン","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"初代マーリン","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}